  3→     3→//! Mounts the encrypted vault at ~/CipherBox as a native filesystem.
  4→     4→//! On macOS: FUSE-T (fuser crate). On Windows: WinFsp (winfsp crate).
  5→     5→//! All crypto operations happen in Rust via the crypto module.
